@action takeKey {
  $hasKey = true;
  $insight += 1;
  $log.push({id: $log.length, text: "You accepted the brass key from the archivist."});
}

# The Nocturne Archive

THE NOCTURNE ARCHIVE / CHAPTER 01

The clock stopped at midnight. **{{ $player.name }}**, this archive keeps not books,
but the things people forgot they once knew.

::: dialogue {speaker="Irene" mood="calm"}
“The name is not important. What matters is whether you will read it again.”
:::

@if (!$hasKey) {
  A [brass key]{.warning} rests on the desk. Its back bears a nearly forgotten word:
  *gneh3-*.

  [[Take the key => takeKey]]
} @else {
  You close your hand around the key. The archive's northern door can now open.
}

[[Enter the reading room - Karlowe -> ReadingRoom]]

[[Enter the vault - Sugarcast -> Vault]]

